# Phase 4: Move Logic to FastAPI

Current:

```text
Streamlit
   ↓
Model
```

Target:

```text
Streamlit
   ↓
FastAPI
   ↓
Model
```

Endpoints:

```python
POST /predict
GET /articles
GET /sentiment-summary
```

### Why?

This mimics production microservices.

